                  "mimeType" : "application/json",
                  "size" : 648769,
                  "text" : "{\"status\":\"ok\",\"message\":\"\",\"body\":{\"featuredBlogPosts\":[{\"id\":5186,\"blog_id\":12,\"client_id\":6,\"company_id\":13,\"parent_company_id\":3,\"created_by_administrator_id\":0,\"code\":\"\",\"parent_blog_post_id\":5186,\"title\":\"DEWAR'S SCOTCH WHISKY RETURNS TO THE U.S. OPEN, DEBUTING THE NEWEST ITERATION OF \\\"THE CHAMPIONS EDITION\\\" 19 YEAR OLD WHISKY\",\"subtitle\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"language_id\":1,\"use_for_all_languages\":false,\"body\":\"<p>HAMILTON, Bermuda, June 11, 2025 /PRNewswire/ -- DEWAR'S&reg; Blended Scotch Whisky proudly&nbsp;announces the release of the fifth iteration of DEWAR'S 19 Year Old The Champions Edition, in&nbsp;celebration of the 125th U.S. Open held at Oakmont Country Club in Pittsburgh, PA. This limited-edition,&nbsp;collector's bottle honors the continued partnership between the two iconic brands, celebrating the&nbsp;craftsmanship, prestige, and legacy found in both the world of golf and fine whisky.</p>\\n<p>Finished in <strong>Calvados Apple Brandy Casks</strong>, this year's edition honors apple bran... [truncated to save space (647493 more bytes)]"
